===Etymology===
From {{inh|non|gem-pro|*twai}}, whence also {{cog|ang|twā}} ({{cog|en|two}}), {{cog|ofs|twā}}, {{cog|osx|twā}}, {{m|osx|twō}}, {{cog|nl|twee}}, {{cog|de|zwei}}, {{cog|got|𐍄𐍅𐌰𐌹}}. Compare also {{cog|ang|twēġen}} ({{cog|en|twain}}), {{cog|osx|twēne}}, {{cog|goh|zwēne}} ({{cog|de|zween}}). Ultimately from {{der|non|ine-pro|*dwó}}, whence also {{cog|la|duo}}, {{cog|grc|δύο}}.

